===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|drow}}

# {{lb|en|fantasy|_|RPG|countable}} A member of a fictional race of dark [[elf|elves]] in various fantasy settings, such as ''[[w:Dungeons & Dragons|Dungeons & Dragons]]''.
# {{lb|en|fantasy|_|RPG|uncountable}} A fictional [[constructed language]] spoken by the Drow. <!--capital D?-->
# {{lb|en|rare|mythology|countable}} A [[trow]]; a member of a race of folkloric beings from [[Orkney]] and [[Shetland]]; cognate to the Scandinavian [[troll]]<ref>{{cite-web |title=Dictionary of the Scots Language |url=http://www.dsl.ac.uk/dsl/getent4.php?plen=11075&startset=44442733&query=TROW&fhit=trowe&dregion=entry&dtext=snd#fhit |accessdate=23 July 2012 |archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20120205103333/http://www.dsl.ac.uk/dsl/getent4.php?plen=11075&startset=44442733&query=TROW&fhit=trowe&dregion=entry&dtext=snd#fhit#fhit |archivedate=5 February 2012 }}</ref>.

